  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :&nbsp;</strong><a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://btsc.bihar.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Bihar Technical Services Commission (BTSC)</a></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">has released the Result for the post of Pharmacist</span><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">. This recruitment was released for</span> <span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">7274</span><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\"> posts.&nbsp;Applications for the</span><span style=\"font-size: inherit;\"> Bihar BTSC Dresser Recruitment 2025 were accepted from April 12, 2025, to April 15, 2025. The document verification was conducted on 06, 10 February 2026. Candidates who who appeared for this examination can download their Bihar BTSC Pharmacist Result 2026 from the link given below.</span></span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Bihar Technical Services Commission (BTSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">Bihar BTSC Pharmacist Result 2026 </span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Advt.No: 19/2025, 20/2025, 21/2025, 22/2025</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Notification Date : <strong>11 March 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>11 March 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>08 April 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>08 April 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\"></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>13 April 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>16 April 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>16 April 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\"></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>12 April 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>15 April 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>15 April 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>April / May 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>25 April 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Answer Key Objection (Dentist) :&nbsp;<strong>18-21 May 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam Date (Pharmacist) :&nbsp;<strong>04 June 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Admit Card (Pharmacist) : <strong>26 May 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Result Declared : <strong>24 June 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam Date (Dresser) :&nbsp;<strong>08, 09 July 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Admit Card (Dresser) :&nbsp;<strong>01 July 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Dentist Result : <strong>09 July 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Dresser Answer Key : <strong>30 July 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">GMO Result : <strong>10 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Dresser Score Card : <strong>18 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">DV Schedule (Pharmacist) :&nbsp;<strong>06 to 10 February 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Result (Pharmacist) : <strong>15 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, BC, EBC, EWS Candidates : <strong><span class=\"blue bold\">Rs.600</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Other State (All Category) :&nbsp; <strong><span class=\"blue bold\">Rs.600</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST, EBC of Bihar : <strong><span class=\"blue bold\">Rs.150</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><span class=\"blue bold\">All Female of Bihar </span><span class=\"blue bold\">:</span><strong><span class=\"blue bold\"> Rs.150</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Bihar BTSC GMO, Dentist, Dresser &amp; Pharmacist Notification 2025 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Age Limit As On 01 August 2024</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age : <strong>18 Years (Pharmacist &amp; Dresser Post)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age : <strong>21 Years (DMO &amp; Dentist Post)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age : <strong>37 Years (UR)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age : <strong>40 Years (UR Female)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age : <strong>40 Years (BC/ EBC-Male &amp; Female)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age : <strong>42 Years (SC/ ST-Male &amp; Female)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per Bihar BTSC Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Bihar BTSC GMO, Dentist, Dresser &amp; Pharmacist 2025 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 7274 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 120px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 24px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>No. of Post</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 24px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">General Medical (GMO)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">667</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 24px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Dentist</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">808</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 24px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Dresser</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">3326</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 24px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Pharmacist</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; height: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">2473</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Bihar BTSC GMO, Dentist, Dresser &amp; Pharmacist Bharti 2025 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>General Medical (GMO)</strong></span> :-&nbsp; Candidates must have an&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"57\" data-end=\"72\">MBBS degree</strong>&nbsp;from an&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"81\" data-end=\"103\">MCI/NMC-recognized</strong>&nbsp;university. Foreign graduates need a&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"141\" data-end=\"199\">4-year MBBS, 1-year internship, and FMGE qualification</strong>. A&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"203\" data-end=\"226\">12-month internship</strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"231\" data-end=\"273\">permanent Medical Council registration</strong>&nbsp;are mandatory.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Dentist</strong></span> :-&nbsp; Candidates must have a&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"56\" data-end=\"70\">BDS degree</strong>&nbsp;from a&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"78\" data-end=\"96\">DCI-recognized</strong>&nbsp;Indian university or an equivalent qualification under the&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"156\" data-end=\"194\">Bihar and Odisha Medical Act, 1916</strong>. Foreign graduates must complete&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"228\" data-end=\"289\">4 years of BDS, 1-year internship, and pass the FDST exam</strong>&nbsp;conducted by NBEMS for their degree to be considered valid.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Dresser</strong></span> :-&nbsp; Candidates must have&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"54\" data-end=\"71\">Matriculation</strong>&nbsp;and a&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"78\" data-end=\"99\">C.M.D certificate</strong>&nbsp;from a&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"107\" data-end=\"144\">government-recognized institution</strong>.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Pharmacist</strong></span> :-&nbsp; Candidates must have&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"54\" data-end=\"72\">10+2 (Science)</strong>, a&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"76\" data-end=\"111\">Diploma in Pharmacy (D. Pharma)</strong>&nbsp;from a&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"119\" data-end=\"156\">government-recognized institution</strong>, and&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"162\" data-end=\"210\">registration with the Bihar Pharmacy Council</strong>.&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"212\" data-end=\"289\" data-is-last-node=\"\">B. Pharma and M. Pharma holders must also have a D. Pharma qualification.</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All candidates must read the official information completely before applying.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Bihar BTSC GMO, Dentist, Dresser &amp; Pharmacist Online Form 2025 : </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Selection on the Basis of CBT Exam &amp; Work Experience.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download Bihar BTSC Pharmacist Result 2026 </strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Check the Important Links section</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Then click on the Download Result link</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After clicking on the link, candidates will be redirected to the Dashboard page.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">In this page candidates have to fill up the following fields with proper details:</span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Candidate’s Registration Number</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Date of Birth</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Gender</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Verification Code</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Then the candidates will be required to submit the details in order to download the Result.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">The candidate can also download it from the official Website.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow SarkariExam on Instagram</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Follow Now</a></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; padding: 0px;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3><strong>Important Links</strong></h3>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>Download Result (Pharmacist)<br>\n</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://btsc.bihar.gov.in/sites/default/files/circulars/Result_22_2025.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><b>Click Here</b></a></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style